  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pop Council 2008-2009 - Population Council 2008</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Pop Council 2008-2009</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med forskningsst&#xf6;det &#xe4;r att &#xf6;ka Population Councils m&#xf6;jligheter att forts&#xe4;tta med sina omfattande kraftanstr&#xe4;ngningar f&#xf6;r att f&#xe5; fram fungerande microbicider mot HIV.Organisationen har skapat partnerskap och samarbetar p&#xe5; olika niv&#xe5;er med olika akt&#xf6;rer.Nyligen genomf&#xf6;rde organisationen en fas-III studie av microbiociden Carraguard, en milstolpe inom mikrobiocidforskningen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Population Council recently completed a large phase III efficacy clinical trial with its lead candidate microbicide, Carraguard,a gel that is delivered vaginally. Although Carraguard was not shown to be effective in preventing male-to-female transmission of HIV,this trial represents a major milestone in the implementation and conduct of clinical microbiocide research.</narrative>
  </description>
